WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:04.958
It is the year twenty sixty-one. Vanta is a city
in

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:09.801
the mountains. Here, an address also opens the
door to a digital life.

00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:14.149
The Core, run by the UNO network, connects every
resident to

00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:18.933
their home, their mailbox and the city’s
services. People use it every day.

00:00:20.095 --> 00:00:23.645
You are the new cybersecurity trainee. Tonight
is your first watch

00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:27.195
at UNO. Your job is to listen to residents and
record

00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:28.486
what you can verify.

00:00:29.637 --> 00:00:33.358
The last call comes from Alma, a Vanta resident.
She’s been

00:00:33.358 --> 00:00:35.725
trying to open her mailbox all night.

00:00:36.025 --> 00:00:39.449
My daughter left me a message before she left
school. Can

00:00:39.449 --> 00:00:41.627
you tell me if it’s still there?

00:00:42.762 --> 00:00:46.180
At seventeen minutes past midnight, a continuity
order removes the entries

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:50.220
that tell the Core where to find Vanta and who
owns its files.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.958
The city drops off the map. The portal stops
recognizing its

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:58.589
residents’ addresses. Alma’s voice is still on
the line.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:03.615
One second after the outage, the North relay
receives a signal.

00:01:03.615 --> 00:01:08.218
Some equipment is still responding, and copies
from the last shift are intact.

00:01:08.518 --> 00:01:11.553
That gives you a lead. The route that finds the
city

00:01:11.553 --> 00:01:14.588
and the service that holds its data are two
different things.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:19.886
The shift lead gives you an authorized copy of
the handover

00:01:19.886 --> 00:01:24.053
folder. After this watch, you’ll receive
archivist access to investigate the

00:01:24.053 --> 00:01:26.325
order and help residents regain access.

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:30.692
Save the last log. Open the terminal. Vanta
needs someone to

00:01:30.692 --> 00:01:32.910
keep a record of what happened.
